No licence has been selected for this repository.

That is a deliberate open decision, not an oversight. See the "Licence" section of
README.md for why, and note in particular that the clean-room rule this project is built
under exists because the Community Edition is published under a licence that is not an
open source licence and that restricts distribution of derivative work. Choosing a
licence before legal advice is taken risks choosing one this repository is not eligible
for.

Until the owner selects a licence, and until the owner has taken legal advice on it, no
rights are granted in the contents of this repository. Nothing here is licensed for use,
copying, modification or redistribution. You have no permission to do any of those.

When a licence is chosen it will replace this file, and that choice needs the owner's
decision.

Nothing in this file is legal advice.